    "innovation": "This paper applies the simple climate model MAGICC6 to interpret complex climate model results, showing that incomplete forcings in CMIP3 reduced projected warming, and provides new, extended temperature projections for the Representative Concentration Pathways (RCPs) used in the subsequent CMIP5 intercomparison.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
