            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "Fig. 5. Net radiative forcing (panel a) and global-mean surface temperatures (b) for the SRES A1B scenario using MAGICC4.2 as presented in IPCC AR4. The standard radiative forcing used by MAGICC4.2 is compared to the means across all 19 CMIP3 AOGCMs, as diagnosed by Forster and Taylor (2006) (panel a), resulting in an apparently relatively close agreement (see text).",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
